## Bảng dữ liệu


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
meta_data |>
  select(study_id, year, region, method_quality, sample_size, effect_size, standard_error) |>
  head(10) |>
  gt() |>
  tab_header(
    title = "Example Meta-analysis Dataset",
    subtitle = "Simulated public data"
  ) |>
  fmt_number(
    columns = c(effect_size, standard_error),
    decimals = 3
  )
```

