# 12. Viết kết quả học thuật

::: {.callout-note title="Kiến thức nền tảng (Knowledge Notes)"}

Khi viết meta-analysis, cần báo cáo:

- Số nghiên cứu
- Tổng sample size nếu phù hợp
- Effect size metric
- Model fixed/random
- Pooled effect
- Confidence interval
- Heterogeneity
- Publication bias
- Subgroup hoặc meta-regression nếu có

:::

## Template pooled effect

```text
A random-effects meta-analysis was conducted across [k] studies. The pooled effect size was [estimate], 95% CI [lower, upper], indicating [interpretation].
```

## Template heterogeneity

```text
Heterogeneity across studies was [low/moderate/high], as indicated by I² = [value]%. This suggests that effect sizes varied across study contexts.
```

## Template forest plot

```text
The forest plot shows that most studies reported positive effects, although confidence intervals varied across studies.
```

## Template publication bias

```text
Visual inspection of the funnel plot suggested [symmetry/asymmetry]. However, this result should be interpreted cautiously because funnel plot asymmetry may reflect heterogeneity as well as publication bias.
```

## Template meta-regression

```text
Meta-regression was conducted to examine whether study-level characteristics explained variation in effect sizes. The results suggested that [moderator] was [associated/not associated] with effect size variation.
```

::: {.callout-warning title="Sai lầm thường gặp (Common Mistakes)"}

Không nên viết:

```text
Meta-analysis proved that the intervention works in all contexts.
```

Nên viết:

```text
The pooled evidence suggests a positive average effect, although heterogeneity indicates that effects may vary across contexts.
```

:::

